& [SpecificationIdentity] is pure implementation authority
  + [specification_uuid] is 41b3f145-0c4f-4dae-8e29-cc2c29823a34
  + [profile] is cantor-windows-stream-info-parser/0.1
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 538c3eed-9bc7-458a-ab3d-2a16ce1560f8
  + [target_module] is crates/cantor_ecosystem/src/windows_stream_info_parser.rs

& [InputContract] is exact
  + [bytes] are the exact successful returned region
  + [maximum_entries] is 1 through 1024
  + [maximum_name_utf16_units] is 1 through 32767
  + [minimum_nonempty_region] is one 24-byte header plus one UTF-16 code unit

& [EntryContract] is structural
  + [header_size] is 24
  + [endianness] is little endian
  + [next_offset] zero terminates; nonzero is at least header plus name, divisible by eight, and within the region
  + [name_length] is positive even bytes and within the caller unit limit
  + [sizes] are nonnegative signed inputs released as u64
  + [name] decodes strict UTF-16LE without replacement or NUL termination
  + [grammar] is exactly ::$DATA or :nonempty:$DATA
  + [terminal] final header plus name ends exactly at region length
  + [padding] between name end and next offset is ignored

& [OutputContract] is inspectable
  + records retain source order and source byte offset
  + names retain exact decoded scalar sequence
  + no sorting, uniqueness, default-stream count, named-stream admission, or kind policy occurs

& [Requirements] are M2B-SIP-001 through M2B-SIP-010
  + strict limits and exact region
  + little-endian header decode
  + checked offsets and eight-byte alignment
  + positive even bounded names
  + strict UTF-16 and stream-name grammar
  + nonnegative sizes
  + exact terminal exhaustion
  + ignored padding
  + closed faults and no partial release
  + zero-effect verification, evidence, rollback, and nonclaims

& [ImplementationBoundary] is pure
  + [Cargo_and_lock_delta] is zero
  + [unsafe] is zero
  - never: import windows-sys or use filesystem, process, environment, clock, network, persistence, model, or physical APIs

& [SatisfactionSignature] is valid for pure implementation
  + [signature_protocol_uuid] is 876a8675-dcb1-4126-87e0-30c92732ce4b
  + [signature_uuid] is 4c36dfd3-93b4-4654-b8f7-5031d0ec83cc
  + [status] is valid
  + [implementation_authority] is one pure parser module, export, tests, and proof records
  + [execution_authority] is in-memory supplied-byte tests only
  + [invalidation] is any platform call, pointer dereference, unsafe, partial success, unbounded allocation, admitted malformed chain, profile change, dependency delta, or physical claim
